Package: pulzr-modbus
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@pulzr.net>
License: Apache-2.0
Architecture: @ARCH@
Provides: pulzr-cap-modbus
Depends: pulzr-edge=@VERSION@
Description: Modbus RTU and TCP devices behind the gateway, on pulzr-edge.
 Speaks the Pulzar protocol for the devices on the gateway's own buses over one
 MQTT session with the gateway's own broker login. Reads its buses from
 /etc/pulzr-edge/buses.toml and starts once the gateway is adopted.
